pan></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">○&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">수강료 추가 납부기간 : 2011. 12. 15(목) ~ 12. 16(금), 2일간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><br>○ 수강료 납부자 수강취소 및 수강료 반환신청 : 2011. 12. 19(월)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ～</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">12. 20(화)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 첨부신청서식(2)을 작성하여&nbsp;교무연구처(본관201호)로 제출<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>○</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #333333; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;수강료 고지서&nbsp;발급 및 납부안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: #333333; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: #333333; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><img height=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00000d78340e.gif\" width=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #333333; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">* 고지서 발급 : 원스톱서비스-등록-등록금 고지내역 조회/출력<br>* 수강료 납부<br></span><span style=\"COLOR: #333333; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; ■ 은행 직접 방문 납부 : 고지서 지참<br>&nbsp; ■ 개인별 가상계좌번호로 등록금 입금(인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 등 이용시)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">받는 사람(학생본인이름) 필히 확인<br></span><span style=\"COLOR: #333333; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 보내는 사람은 학생이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: #333333; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><img height=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00000d783410.gif\" width=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #333333; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">*&nbsp;수강료 납부기간 : 12.15.(목)~12.16(금)<br>*&nbsp;수강료 납부장소 : 농협, 우체국<br>* 수강료 납부확인 : 12월말까지 ’원스톱서비스-등록’에서 발급</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: #333333; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><img height=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI00000d783412.gif\" width=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>첨부 1. 폐강과목 수강정정 신청서 1부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 계절수업 수강취소 및 수강료 반환신청서 1부.<br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
